Default:
.BR 0 .
.TP
.BI cert_options.user.require.equals: " string"
Passes when the claim's scalar string value equals this string.
Default:
.BR empty .
.TP
.BI cert_options.user.require.one_of: " list"
Passes when the claim's scalar string value appears in this set.
Default:
.BR empty .
.TP
.BI cert_options.user.require.contains: " string"
Passes when this value appears in a list\-valued claim. A scalar claim takes the absent path \(em the condition fails, loudly.
Default:
.BR empty .
.TP
.BI cert_options.user.require.all_of: " list"
Passes when every listed condition passes. Listed conditions may not themselves carry all_of or any_of; nesting stops at one level.
Default:
.BR empty .
.TP
.BI cert_options.user.require.any_of: " list"
